WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.137
Arms Exports.

00:00:02.087 --> 00:00:06.312
Canada is the 16th largest arms exporter on Earth.

00:00:06.312 --> 00:00:15.450
A $15-billion deal sold 928 armoured vehicles to Saudi Arabia while the Saudi-led coalition bombed school buses in Yemen.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.412
Harper signed it.

00:00:17.412 --> 00:00:19.862
Trudeau refused to cancel.

00:00:19.862 --> 00:00:24.225
377,000+ people are dead.

00:00:24.225 --> 00:00:26.512
Both parties own this.

00:00:26.512 --> 00:00:34.037
Every number below comes from government reports, SIPRI data, UN investigations, and Amnesty International.
